    23	  slot_2: alternative 2D embeddings — residue-class grid (n mod p, n div p) for p = 2, 3, 5, 7, 11; polynomial-image grid (n, n^2 mod p). Compute L(N) for each. Cross-embedding scaling fit.
    24	  slot_3: theoretical shape — does L(N) follow Szemeredi-Trotter incidence bound L(N) >= pi(N)^{2/3} (random-points lower bound), or beat it via HL alignment? If beats, by what HL-related factor?
